{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"List and Table Components","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build scrollable, navigable data collections with keyboard support."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit provides two components for displaying collections of data:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A vertical collection of arbitrary view content with selection support","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Table"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A columnar data display with headers and configurable column widths"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both components share the same keyboard navigation and selection infrastructure, providing a consistent user experience."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"List","level":2,"anchor":"List","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"List"},{"type":"text","text":" displays a vertical collection of items inside a bordered container. It supports:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional title in the border","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Optional footer section","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Single or multi-selection","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keyboard naviga